# Compiled scripts/, including prepublish.js — it takes a parameterized
# bundle root and recursively deletes it, so it must never reach an adopter.
# package.json's `files` allowlist also excludes it; this makes the exclusion
# that PRD-005 § 8 names as the mechanism actually load-bearing.
